{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>網上女士們總能以聰明而簡潔的機智，為我們的一天增添色彩。</p>\n<p>HuffPost Women每週都會匯集她們搞笑的言論。瀏覽今週由女性發表的精彩推文、串文及其他貼文，然後到訪我們的「女性最搞笑推文」專頁，查看過往的精選內容。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T17:44:29.748046+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":0,"source":"HuffPost 生活","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:00:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T22:18:05.665197+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T17:38:33.174588+00:00","content_hash":"804ea8919369555b60a29ebe49a2394851cf698ee00b63198ada1b11c164f380","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":"HTTP 406","content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T17:44:29.748046+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-blocked","latest_error":"HTTP 406"},"content_capture":null}